 Reason\", \"Re-Education (Through Labor)\", which peaked at number three and the third single \"Savior\".", "rerank_score": 2.2815}], "candidate_answer": "yes", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 17}
