ok of reportage by the Austrian writer Joseph Roth from the era of the Weimar Republic.  The selection of pieces from Roth's large journalistic output was made by Michael Bienert and published in German in 1996.  The English translation with the present title was made by Michael Hofmann and appeared in 2003.", "rerank_score": -0.7361}], "candidate_answer": "yes", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 14}
