ailway Corporation (KCRC) before the construction of \"KCR West Rail\" (now known as West Rail Line).", "rerank_score": 2.8608}, {"title": "Nam Cheong Station", "text": "Nam Cheong () is a MTR interchange station located at ground level beneath West Kowloon Highway, in Sham Shui Po, Hong Kong opposite the Fu Cheong Estate.  It is served by the Tung Chung Line and West Rail Line and provides cross-platform interchange between platform 1 (West Rail Line towards Tuen Mun) and platform 4 (Tung Chung Line towards Hong Kong).  The livery of Nam Cheong Station is pale yellow green.", "rerank_score": 2.3885}], "candidate_answer": "Tsim Sha Tsui, Hong Kong", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 15}
