)\".  In 2010 to 2011, she was in the main South Korean musical production of \"Jekyll & Hyde\" as Lucy.  In 2012 to 2013, she reprised her role as Lucy in the South Korean national tour.", "rerank_score": 1.8559}], "candidate_answer": "The Producers", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 21}
