text": "He is also a former member of the Ateneo Blue Eagles in the UAAP and the Philippine national basketball team on many occasions.", "rerank_score": -3.9224}], "candidate_answer": "Donald Hugh Henley", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 27}
