y charter and the fact that he was serving as President Pro Tempore of the City Council.  However, Wilson found himself literally locked out of the mayor's office\u2014he was told that the keys could not be found.", "rerank_score": 1.1092}], "candidate_answer": "Northwest Side", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 14}
