y October 2005 and was released on 18 October 2005 for Microsoft Windows and later for Linux, Xbox 360 and OS X.  A special DVD Collectors Edition was released, including promotional material and the game \"Quake II\" with its expansions, \"The Reckoning\" and \"Ground Zero\".", "rerank_score": 0.6234}], "candidate_answer": "Doom", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 17}
