erly travelling companion seems to have disappeared from the train.  After her fellow passengers deny ever having seen the elderly lady, the young woman is helped by a young musicologist, the two proceeding to search the train for clues to the old lady's disappearance.", "rerank_score": 0.6889}, {"title": "Jenny Runacre", "text": "Jenny Runacre (born 18 August 1946) is a South African-born English actress.  Her film appearances include \"The Passenger\" (1975), \"The Duellists\" (1977), \"Jubilee\" (1978), \"The Lady Vanishes\" (1979), and \"The Witches\" (1990).", "rerank_score": 0.6432}], "candidate_answer": "Tuppence Middleton", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 12}
