3.  It involves a Brazilian remake of the Mexican telenovela Carrusel (which in turn had been inspired by the Argentinean telenovela \"Jacinta Pichimahuida, la Maestra que no se Olvida\").", "rerank_score": 0.9703}], "candidate_answer": "Quincea\u00f1era", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 11}
