s Asplund", "text": "About the incident, Asplund is quoted as having said \u201cIf this picture of me can get more people to dare to show resistance, then it\u2019s all good...the people must unite and show that it is not okay that racism is becoming normalised and that fascists are running around on our streets.\u201d", "rerank_score": -4.4143}], "candidate_answer": "Sweden, Finland, and Norway", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 14}
