ance on the group's third album \"Kicking Against The Pricks\" (1986).", "rerank_score": 4.8149}], "candidate_answer": "Nick Cave", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 15}
