 in which it is solemnly consecrated; And in 1677, year of the death of Cardinal Don Pascual de Arag\u00f3n, his patron, the works of the conventual dependences are practically finished.", "rerank_score": -4.4086}, {"title": "Royal Opera House", "text": "The Royal Opera House is an opera house and major performing arts venue in Covent Garden, central London.  The large building is often referred to as simply \"Covent Garden\", after a previous use of the site of the opera house's original construction in 1732.  It is the home of The Royal Opera, The Royal Ballet, and the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House.", "rerank_score": -4.9963}], "candidate_answer": "The Royal Opera House", "source": "gold", "generator": "gold", "difficulty": "trivial", "transformation": null, "expected_label_hint": "SUPPORTED", "corpus_size": 16}
